  "details": "i have heard of people who had 10k member groups and got their member base banned overnight, i never gave such permission combined to the ability to look at the list of members because of this, and i know that the people must be trusted, but this will help any group owner to sleep better overnight.\n\nWhy\n\ni believe that we should have a way to prevent mass banning of users that are not even on sight.\n\nHow\n\nby adding a role that is just like the instance kick but called instance ban, and it should act like a ban but who has it can only ban who is in the instance.",
